  "details": "So for some of us that have the index we do not have the ability to do certain gestures like other controllers do.  I believe there should be support for thumb states on your index controllers.  This would allow more mobility for those using ASL in vrchat as the thumb states currently are not really usable for to many poses.  Being able to override the default animations for the index controllers with new ones from Unity that you make would be very useful for a lot of people.",
